    "text_columns_LaNNzH": {
      "type": "text-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_AeQxj4": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-13_at_4.12.29_PM.jpg",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>The <a href=\"/collections/no-appologies-club\" title=\"No Appologies club\"><strong>No Apologies Club Hoodie</strong></a> is made for those who move with confidence and don\u2019t follow rules \u2014 they set them.</p><p>Crafted from a soft, heavyweight fabric with a relaxed fit, this hoodie delivers all-day comfort while making a bold statement. The striking red embroidery stands out against deep black fabric, creating a powerful streetwear essential you can wear anywhere.</p>",
            "button_label": "Learn More",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/no-apologies-club"
          }
        },
        "text_block_4XdNgh": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-13_at_4.12.37_PM.jpg",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 650,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>This hoodie is built around clean lines, heavy fabric, and a statement that doesn\u2019t ask for approval. Minimal design up front. Maximum attitude in red.</p><p></p><p>Part of the <strong>FredJo capsule</strong>, it\u2019s designed to move easily from street to off-duty without trying too hard. Wear it once and it becomes the default.</p>",
            "button_label": "Learn More",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/oversized-hoodies"
          }
        },
        "text_block_fLb3mP": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ChatGPT_Image_Dec_5_2025_09_51_56_PM.png",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 300,
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Streetwear is more than clothing \u2014 it\u2019s culture in motion. We created this brand for those who see style as self-expression, not just fashion. Inspired by global street culture and the evolution of modern streetwear, our mission is simple: <strong>create timeless pieces that represent confidence, individuality, and community</strong>.</p><p></p>",
            "button_label": "Learn More",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/sweatshirts"
          }
        }
      },
